    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d199">

                <pb facs="0428" n="418" xml:id="pg418"/>

                <head>Laird Brothers to her
                        Majesty’s Treasury.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Birkenhead Iron Works,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Birkenhead,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-01-09"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 9, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> We wrote to you on the 30th December,
                    drawing attention to our letter of 22d December, respecting the insurance on the
                    El Tousson and El Monnassir, and asking a reply thereto.</p>
                <p>As we have not yet received any communication on the subject, we would again
                    respectfully ask an early reply.</p>
                <p>We are, sir, your obedient servants,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>LAIRD BROTHERS.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>The <hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary to the Treasury.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
